Redrob Canvas's editors started as four projects, each MIT OR Apache-2.0: PhotoCraft
(now editors/photo), VectorCraft (editors/vector), DesignCraft (editors/layout) and craft-libs
(editors/shared), all from https://github.com/storytold. They are no longer synced with those
projects; the commits they came from are in SOURCE_ORIGINS.md. Their NOTICE files are reproduced
verbatim below, unchanged; their LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE and NOTICE files also remain in
place under editors/<name>/.

The ArtCraft name, wordmark and logos are trademarks of the ArtCraft Team. They are not open
source, are not covered by any licence above, and are neither used nor shipped by Redrob Canvas.

The complete inventory of Rust packages this build resolves, with their licence texts, is the
generated THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

